abstract: |
  A comprehensive research project focused on building an intelligent diagnostic pipeline for identifying and assessing crop pathologies in real-world field conditions. The system utilizes Swin Transformers for classification, DETR for detection, and SAM2 for precise severity segmentation, integrated with environmental context.
